sequenceDiagram
    participant Owner as Owner (Flutter)
    participant API as ElysiaJS API
    participant DB as Neon DB
    participant Friend as Friend (Flutter)

    Note over Owner,DB: ── Owner generates invite ──

    Owner->>API: POST /bills/:id/invite
    API->>DB: SELECT invite_code FROM bills WHERE id
    DB-->>API: invite_code (e.g. "ABC123")
    API-->>Owner: {invite_code, deep_link}
    Owner->>Owner: show QR Code + "Copy Link" button

    Note over Owner,Friend: ── Friend joins via QR or link ──

    Friend->>Friend: scan QR / tap deep link
    Friend->>API: POST /bills/join/ABC123
    API->>DB: SELECT bill WHERE invite_code = 'ABC123'
    DB-->>API: bill found

    alt User not yet a member
        API->>DB: INSERT bill_members {bill_id, user_id, role: 'member'}
        DB-->>API: member added
        API->>DB: SELECT bill_items WHERE bill_id
        DB-->>API: existing items list
        API-->>Friend: {bill, items, members}
        Friend->>Friend: navigate → Assign Screen
    else Already a member
        API-->>Friend: {bill, items, members} (rejoin)
        Friend->>Friend: navigate → Assign Screen
    end

    Note over Owner: Owner sees new member<br/>appear in member list
